Good to know
  • 1 dynamic env lookup (like `process.env[name]`) could not be analyzed;
    variables read that way are not checked.
  • Git checks (EG008, EG009) were skipped: run EnvGuard inside a git work tree
    with git installed.

Next steps
  1. Fix the 6 errors first: they break deploys or expose secrets.
  2. Learn more about a rule: `envguard explain EG014` (all rules:
     `envguard explain --list`).
  3. Run `envguard check` in CI: it exits 1 on errors and annotates pull
     requests in GitHub Actions.
